# Harbourmaster Rouhi on Sargasso Town's quay (CIPlay sargasso_town_talk, 11-12 w16 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). She
# stands at -0.8 -16.3 (deck 1). Her store: a shed off the quay (x -1.5..-6, z -21.5..-17), door sgstoredoor at -1.5 -19.25,
# barred until you have talked to her; then the door goes and the chest sgstorechest shows. Answers: the weed town
# (journal), the way through the weed (landmarks), leave.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island Sargasso Town keep
offset 0.0553 1.1623
hour 11
weather Calm

at 0.75 -25 h=2
walk 0.75 -25 to 0.75 -19.25 to -0.6 -19.25 h=1
picture sg_store 2.5 +2 -19.25 -3 +1 -19.25
expect hidden sgstorechest
use sgstoredoor
expect message barred
expect shown sgstoredoor
walk -0.6 -19.25 to 0.6 -17.5 h=1
use Harbourmaster Rouhi pick 1
read Harbourmaster Rouhi: the weed town
use Harbourmaster Rouhi pick 2
expect message cut through the rim
use Harbourmaster Rouhi pick 3
expect message Fair winds
walk 0.6 -17.5 to -0.6 -19.25 h=1
use sgstoredoor
expect hidden sgstoredoor
expect shown sgstorechest
walk -0.6 -19.25 to -2.5 -19.25 to -4.2 -18.6 h=1
open Harbourmaster's store chest
wait 2
expect item Hinge 2
expect item Plank 6
